        Wait-PAWVMExists -VMname "PAW-01" -TimeoutSeconds 600
        Waits up to 10 minutes for PAW-01 to appear.

    .NOTES
        Version : 2.0.0.1
        Author  : The Fantastic PAWDeploy Team

    #>
    [cmdletbinding()]
    Param(
        [Parameter(Mandatory = $true)]
